This library implements the over-the-air packet format of the Meshtastic
project (https://meshtastic.org, https://github.com/meshtastic/firmware),
which is licensed under GPL-3.0. The format was documented by reading the
Meshtastic firmware source; docs/wire-format.md cites the relevant
file:line locations. mt-transport shares no code with Meshtastic firmware —
it is an independent implementation of the wire format — but is licensed
GPL-3.0 in acknowledgement of that lineage.

Protobuf message definitions are consumed from the Meshtastic protobufs
repository (https://github.com/meshtastic/protobufs), used under its
GPL-3.0 license.

